  "title": "Association of Korean Atomic Bomb Victims",
  "summary": "Korean survivors of the Hiroshima and Nagasaki bombings formed a victims' association in 1967, which asked the Korean government for aid and a medical centre. Its chapters, notably at Hapcheon, where many survivors settled, work with Japanese civic groups on welfare, recognition and compensation.",
